1
00:00:03,220 --> 00:00:07,250
♪By red walls and a dry well,
my crown gathers dust and frost♪

2
00:00:07,640 --> 00:00:11,860
♪With a hoe and a patch of wasteland,
I sow the moonlight♪

3
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:16,120
♪Who says the Cold Palace
holds nothing but tears?♪

4
00:00:16,310 --> 00:00:20,330
♪I choose to fill it with fragrant wine♪

5
00:00:20,670 --> 00:00:22,200
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

6
00:00:22,250 --> 00:00:24,730
♪Growing life's simple joys♪

7
00:00:24,800 --> 00:00:26,880
♪Bins full of grain, jars full of wine♪

8
00:00:26,970 --> 00:00:28,760
♪Better than dancing in silks♪

9
00:00:29,420 --> 00:00:30,650
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

10
00:00:30,930 --> 00:00:33,320
♪My heart longs for the world beyond♪

11
00:00:33,690 --> 00:00:35,800
♪Tending a courtyard full of life♪

12
00:00:36,140 --> 00:00:40,560
♪Come, share a cup with me♪

13
00:00:40,570 --> 00:00:42,540
(Welcome to Cold Palace Refreshments)

14
00:00:45,720 --> 00:00:47,040
=Farm Busily in the Cold Palace=

15
00:00:47,040 --> 00:00:48,620
(Based on Hongshu.com's Novel
I'm Busy Farming in the Cold Palace)

16
00:00:48,620 --> 00:00:49,650
=Episode 8=

17
00:00:50,303 --> 00:00:51,556
(Welcome to Cold Palace Refreshments)

18
00:00:53,479 --> 00:00:54,280
Your Majesty.

19
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:56,439
His Majesty summons you to Shuxin Hall.

20
00:00:56,799 --> 00:00:57,759
What for?

21
00:00:57,759 --> 00:00:58,640
(Cold Palace Refreshments)

22
00:00:58,640 --> 00:00:59,600
I'm busy.

23
00:00:59,600 --> 00:01:00,640
He says

24
00:01:00,640 --> 00:01:02,560
he has a big deal to discuss with you.

25
00:01:06,480 --> 00:01:07,280
How big?

26
00:01:07,799 --> 00:01:08,799
50,000 imperial guards.

27
00:01:08,799 --> 00:01:10,280
A daily supply of ice pops.

28
00:01:12,719 --> 00:01:13,760
Here you go, Eunuch Cao.

29
00:01:13,760 --> 00:01:14,959
Something to cool you down.

30
00:01:14,959 --> 00:01:15,480
Lead the way!

31
00:01:21,760 --> 00:01:24,120
(No wonder His Majesty sent someone
to buy it in secret yesterday!)

32
00:01:24,400 --> 00:01:26,319
(The Empress is making a comeback.)

33
00:01:26,439 --> 00:01:27,680
(The winds in the harem)

34
00:01:27,680 --> 00:01:29,200
(may be shifting.)

35
00:01:34,519 --> 00:01:35,840
I summoned you here today

36
00:01:36,079 --> 00:01:37,400
without any secrecy.

37
00:01:37,719 --> 00:01:39,840
Why are you still dressed as a eunuch?

38
00:01:41,640 --> 00:01:43,480
It's easier to get around

39
00:01:43,480 --> 00:01:44,200
in these clothes.

40
00:01:44,200 --> 00:01:45,000
I'm used to it.

41
00:01:46,799 --> 00:01:49,000
Would you like to leave the Cold Palace?

42
00:01:51,400 --> 00:01:52,680
I could give you a courtyard

43
00:01:53,319 --> 00:01:54,640
near my side hall.

44
00:01:54,879 --> 00:01:55,640
No need.

45
00:01:56,120 --> 00:01:57,079
I don't wish to.

46
00:01:57,280 --> 00:01:59,200
Seeing Your Majesty from afar

47
00:01:59,439 --> 00:02:01,280
is enough for me.

48
00:02:09,199 --> 00:02:10,840
But I prefer you up close.

49
00:02:13,879 --> 00:02:14,719
Your Majesty.

50
00:02:15,400 --> 00:02:17,400
I'm dressed as a eunuch.

51
00:02:17,879 --> 00:02:20,240
What would people think if they saw us?

52
00:02:21,159 --> 00:02:22,520
But I think

53
00:02:23,280 --> 00:02:24,520
this little eunuch

54
00:02:25,280 --> 00:02:27,199
has a certain charm.

55
00:02:35,759 --> 00:02:36,759
(Your Majesty.)

56
00:02:37,319 --> 00:02:40,879
(Prince Chen and Prince Rui
request an audience.)

57
00:02:49,759 --> 00:02:50,759
I hear

58
00:02:51,800 --> 00:02:53,960
you and Prince Chen were in love,

59
00:02:54,199 --> 00:02:55,840
and betrothed since childhood.

60
00:02:56,319 --> 00:02:57,840
When I pretended to be him,

61
00:02:58,479 --> 00:03:00,080
why didn't you expose me?

62
00:03:02,159 --> 00:03:02,879
Well...

63
00:03:04,479 --> 00:03:05,360
I...

64
00:03:07,120 --> 00:03:08,599
Your word is law, Your Majesty.

65
00:03:08,599 --> 00:03:09,879
Whatever you say goes.

66
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:10,639
Well,

67
00:03:10,639 --> 00:03:12,000
they're still waiting outside.

68
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:12,879
- I'll just...
- What?

69
00:03:13,680 --> 00:03:15,599
Afraid he'll see you with me?

70
00:03:15,919 --> 00:03:16,639
Or

71
00:03:16,879 --> 00:03:18,280
do you still have feelings for him?

72
00:03:36,960 --> 00:03:37,759
Send them in.

73
00:03:47,356 --> 00:03:50,463
(Prince Chen)

74
00:04:05,520 --> 00:04:06,960
What's wrong, Uncle?

75
00:04:07,560 --> 00:04:08,360
Nothing.

76
00:04:08,960 --> 00:04:11,000
Greetings, Your Majesty.

77
00:04:11,616 --> 00:04:12,897
(Prince Rui)

78
00:04:12,919 --> 00:04:13,800
Greetings, Brother.

79
00:04:13,960 --> 00:04:14,680
Rise.

80
00:04:14,919 --> 00:04:15,800
Be seated.

81
00:04:15,800 --> 00:04:16,600
Thank you, Brother.

82
00:04:21,720 --> 00:04:23,240
(They're handsome too!)

83
00:04:23,399 --> 00:04:25,000
(One's cute, lively,
fair-skinned and boyish.)

84
00:04:25,040 --> 00:04:26,800
(A refined man with a rich, deep voice.)

85
00:04:27,120 --> 00:04:29,480
(What amazing royal genes!)

86
00:04:30,959 --> 00:04:32,720
Hiding someone, Brother?

87
00:04:33,199 --> 00:04:34,279
Which consort is this?

88
00:04:34,800 --> 00:04:36,600
Why is she dressed as a eunuch?

89
00:04:37,519 --> 00:04:38,959
Just a little bedroom role-play.

90
00:04:43,720 --> 00:04:44,519
Uncle,

91
00:04:44,879 --> 00:04:46,560
are you still unwell?

92
00:04:48,720 --> 00:04:50,000
I may never get better.

93
00:04:52,040 --> 00:04:53,120
What brings you here?

94
00:04:53,639 --> 00:04:55,360
The people of Yuanzhou.

95
00:04:55,639 --> 00:04:57,600
You did bring rain recently,

96
00:04:57,600 --> 00:04:59,319
but crops take time to grow.

97
00:04:59,319 --> 00:05:01,240
Half a year's harvest
is looking hopeless.

98
00:05:01,399 --> 00:05:03,959
Now grain merchants are hoarding grain!

99
00:05:04,040 --> 00:05:04,759
They're charging

100
00:05:04,759 --> 00:05:07,079
10 taels for 10 dou of rice!
[*Dou =ancient volume unit]

101
00:05:07,560 --> 00:05:09,120
(10 taels?)

102
00:05:09,519 --> 00:05:11,879
(That's 500 or 600 yuan
in modern day's money!)

103
00:05:12,319 --> 00:05:13,639
It's not just your fief.

104
00:05:14,319 --> 00:05:16,120
I've had reports from the border too.

105
00:05:16,480 --> 00:05:18,040
Across the realm,

106
00:05:18,279 --> 00:05:19,600
grain prices are soaring.

107
00:05:19,920 --> 00:05:20,839
Brother,

108
00:05:21,079 --> 00:05:22,439
you must do something.

109
00:05:22,680 --> 00:05:23,639
If this goes on,

110
00:05:23,639 --> 00:05:25,079
there will be serious unrest.

111
00:05:28,959 --> 00:05:30,399
Your thoughts, Uncle?

112
00:05:30,680 --> 00:05:31,519
I believe

113
00:05:31,680 --> 00:05:33,720
we must first open the granaries

114
00:05:34,439 --> 00:05:35,959
and feed the people.

115
00:05:39,199 --> 00:05:40,360
With drought everywhere,

116
00:05:40,839 --> 00:05:42,480
our grain reserves are meager.

117
00:05:42,839 --> 00:05:44,680
Even if we gave out every last bit,

118
00:05:45,040 --> 00:05:46,839
it would barely make a dent.

119
00:05:54,079 --> 00:05:54,800
Well...

120
00:05:57,759 --> 00:05:58,319
I...

121
00:05:58,800 --> 00:05:59,759
May I say something?

122
00:06:00,759 --> 00:06:01,560
Of course.

123
00:06:02,600 --> 00:06:03,680
Speak freely.

124
00:06:05,160 --> 00:06:06,519
Allow grain merchants

125
00:06:06,639 --> 00:06:08,680
to set their own prices

126
00:06:08,680 --> 00:06:09,519
with no price cap.

127
00:06:09,600 --> 00:06:10,480
Within two days,

128
00:06:10,639 --> 00:06:11,920
prices will fall.

129
00:06:12,360 --> 00:06:13,120
Absurd!

130
00:06:13,399 --> 00:06:14,680
You're just stirring up trouble.

131
00:06:14,879 --> 00:06:16,399
Do you want the people to starve?

132
00:06:16,800 --> 00:06:17,759
An excellent plan.

133
00:06:18,560 --> 00:06:19,680
They'll undercut each other.

134
00:06:19,839 --> 00:06:20,879
To sell their stock,

135
00:06:21,319 --> 00:06:22,480
they'll have to cut prices.

136
00:06:24,639 --> 00:06:25,560
Uncle!

137
00:06:25,759 --> 00:06:27,319
Why are you joining in?

138
00:06:27,560 --> 00:06:29,279
What would a palace woman know?

139
00:06:29,279 --> 00:06:30,079
I...

140
00:06:33,120 --> 00:06:34,600
Now that's uncalled for.

141
00:06:34,879 --> 00:06:35,959
Judge the idea itself.

142
00:06:36,120 --> 00:06:37,839
What does gender have to do with it?

143
00:06:38,040 --> 00:06:38,720
Fine.

144
00:06:39,199 --> 00:06:41,000
Then let's make a wager.

145
00:06:41,040 --> 00:06:42,639
If prices haven't fallen in two days...

146
00:06:42,639 --> 00:06:43,560
Do as you like with me.

147
00:06:44,959 --> 00:06:46,480
You're my brother's empress.

148
00:06:46,639 --> 00:06:48,439
How could I punish you?

149
00:06:48,439 --> 00:06:50,079
Why assume I'll lose?

150
00:06:50,160 --> 00:06:52,240
What if I win?

151
00:06:52,240 --> 00:06:53,199
Win?

152
00:06:53,360 --> 00:06:55,279
I'll let you ride me like a horse.

153
00:06:56,240 --> 00:06:57,279
I'm not riding a horse.

154
00:06:57,720 --> 00:06:58,680
I want you

155
00:06:58,680 --> 00:06:59,639
to dress as a woman

156
00:06:59,639 --> 00:07:01,040
and walk around the imperial city.

157
00:07:01,040 --> 00:07:01,639
You!

158
00:07:08,240 --> 00:07:09,040
Ridiculous.

159
00:07:13,000 --> 00:07:13,920
However,

160
00:07:15,160 --> 00:07:16,000
I'll allow it.

161
00:07:18,480 --> 00:07:19,399
Brother!

162
00:07:19,680 --> 00:07:20,839
You're taking her side!

163
00:07:22,319 --> 00:07:24,360
You proposed the wager yourself.

164
00:07:24,560 --> 00:07:25,279
What?

165
00:07:25,560 --> 00:07:26,959
Afraid of losing?

166
00:07:29,680 --> 00:07:30,759
You're on!

167
00:07:35,839 --> 00:07:36,959
Anything else, Uncle?

168
00:07:41,000 --> 00:07:41,959
I take my leave.

169
00:07:48,920 --> 00:07:50,879
(Now that's a brooding heartthrob.)

170
00:07:51,079 --> 00:07:54,160
(Way better than noisy Prince Rui.)

171
00:07:57,600 --> 00:07:58,639
Still staring?

172
00:07:59,639 --> 00:08:01,720
Keep staring, I'll poke your eyes out.

173
00:08:01,920 --> 00:08:03,199
I'm not looking!

174
00:08:04,480 --> 00:08:05,480
Look at me.

175
00:08:44,360 --> 00:08:45,360
It's only been a few days,

176
00:08:45,720 --> 00:08:46,799
but your kissing skills

177
00:08:47,399 --> 00:08:48,440
have really improved.

178
00:08:49,600 --> 00:08:51,440
Didn't you prefer experienced men?

179
00:08:56,080 --> 00:08:57,039
Since I'm here,

180
00:08:57,159 --> 00:08:58,080
Want to sleep together?

181
00:09:00,720 --> 00:09:02,399
So my empress likes to take the lead.

182
00:09:03,000 --> 00:09:04,039
Let me make one thing clear.

183
00:09:04,480 --> 00:09:06,080
This is a deal we both agreed to.

184
00:09:06,639 --> 00:09:08,759
The ice pop order for 50,000 guards-

185
00:09:08,759 --> 00:09:09,720
no haggling.

186
00:09:12,240 --> 00:09:13,519
Even now,

187
00:09:13,519 --> 00:09:15,360
you're still haggling with me?

188
00:09:15,559 --> 00:09:17,240
Are ice pops all you think about?

189
00:09:17,240 --> 00:09:18,120
Money too.

190
00:09:18,480 --> 00:09:19,200
You...

191
00:09:22,879 --> 00:09:23,759
Cao Zhongquan!

192
00:09:24,519 --> 00:09:25,799
Take Lady Lu to the Cold Palace.

193
00:09:25,960 --> 00:09:26,440
Well...

194
00:09:26,440 --> 00:09:27,600
This way, Your Majesty.

195
00:09:28,519 --> 00:09:30,200
What a moody man.

196
00:09:30,360 --> 00:09:31,399
Fine. Forget it.

197
00:09:37,240 --> 00:09:39,159
(Heartless woman.)

198
00:09:44,519 --> 00:09:45,360
Yunluo!

199
00:09:48,679 --> 00:09:49,519
Yunluo!

200
00:09:53,279 --> 00:09:54,679
Your Majesty, please wait.

201
00:09:55,320 --> 00:09:56,320
Prince Chen.

202
00:09:56,679 --> 00:09:57,679
You're still here?

203
00:09:59,039 --> 00:10:00,519
The day before your father's arrest,

204
00:10:00,559 --> 00:10:01,960
he had this sent to my fief.

205
00:10:02,440 --> 00:10:04,360
He asked me to give it to you in person.

206
00:10:08,240 --> 00:10:10,120
But that was months ago.

207
00:10:10,679 --> 00:10:11,480
Yes.

208
00:10:12,159 --> 00:10:13,559
I only returned yesterday.

209
00:10:14,039 --> 00:10:15,240
I hope I'm not too late.

210
00:10:16,480 --> 00:10:17,279
Thank you, Prince Chen.

211
00:10:17,879 --> 00:10:20,000
No need to be so formal with me.

212
00:10:24,600 --> 00:10:26,159
(A letter from her father.)

213
00:10:26,840 --> 00:10:27,720
(Sadly,)

214
00:10:28,000 --> 00:10:29,399
(she'll never get to read it.)

215
00:10:31,159 --> 00:10:32,080
My condolences.

216
00:10:34,600 --> 00:10:37,360
(Why does he look sadder than I do?)

217
00:10:38,759 --> 00:10:39,840
Take care, Your Majesty.

218
00:10:40,600 --> 00:10:41,519
I must go.

219
00:10:45,279 --> 00:10:46,000
Bye.

220
00:10:55,919 --> 00:10:58,559
My host and Prince Chen
must have a past.

221
00:11:00,360 --> 00:11:02,279
Why can't I remember it?

222
00:11:06,440 --> 00:11:07,399
Did you take her back?

223
00:11:07,600 --> 00:11:08,320
Yes, Your Majesty.

224
00:11:08,480 --> 00:11:10,799
I watched Her Majesty go inside.

225
00:11:11,480 --> 00:11:13,840
Was Prince Chen waiting outside?

226
00:11:14,559 --> 00:11:16,440
You saw all that, Your Majesty?

227
00:11:20,720 --> 00:11:22,039
Not clearly.

228
00:11:23,120 --> 00:11:24,159
What did they say?

229
00:11:24,559 --> 00:11:27,360
He gave her a letter

230
00:11:27,399 --> 00:11:29,840
entrusted to him by Chancellor Lu.

231
00:11:30,799 --> 00:11:32,679
Did they touch?

232
00:11:33,120 --> 00:11:33,919
No.

233
00:11:34,240 --> 00:11:35,440
Any flirty looks?

234
00:11:36,120 --> 00:11:37,200
None.

235
00:11:39,600 --> 00:11:40,399
I don't believe it.

236
00:11:40,720 --> 00:11:41,720
Act it out for me.

237
00:11:42,720 --> 00:11:44,200
Don't leave out a single expression.

238
00:11:45,279 --> 00:11:46,080
Yes, Your Majesty.

239
00:11:49,159 --> 00:11:49,960
Yunluo!

240
00:11:50,360 --> 00:11:52,039
Your Majesty, please wait.

241
00:11:53,919 --> 00:11:54,799
Prince Chen.

242
00:11:54,799 --> 00:11:56,200
You haven't left yet?

243
00:11:57,159 --> 00:11:58,360
Take care, Your Majesty.

244
00:11:58,399 --> 00:11:59,639
I must go.

245
00:12:04,440 --> 00:12:06,320
(Am I overthinking this?)

246
00:12:10,759 --> 00:12:11,679
Enough.

247
00:12:12,080 --> 00:12:12,840
You may go.

248
00:12:13,039 --> 00:12:13,840
Yes, Your Majesty.

249
00:12:23,919 --> 00:12:25,200
The cotton you grew

250
00:12:25,200 --> 00:12:26,799
is much better than plant ash.

251
00:12:26,919 --> 00:12:28,320
You're a genius, my lady.

252
00:12:29,519 --> 00:12:30,200
Yinshuang.

253
00:12:31,120 --> 00:12:33,519
Was I really betrothed to Prince Chen?

254
00:12:34,519 --> 00:12:36,519
Why ask about that all of a sudden?

255
00:12:37,240 --> 00:12:38,039
Can't I ask?

256
00:12:39,519 --> 00:12:41,120
Your father gave strict orders

257
00:12:42,080 --> 00:12:45,480
that no one mention him to you.

258
00:12:48,080 --> 00:12:49,320
There's no one else here.

259
00:12:49,320 --> 00:12:50,320
Just tell me.

260
00:12:54,159 --> 00:12:57,279
The late Emperor decreed your marriage
to His Majesty.

261
00:12:58,120 --> 00:12:59,960
Prince Chen caused a scene at court

262
00:13:00,200 --> 00:13:01,279
and was banished to his fief.

263
00:13:01,799 --> 00:13:04,360
You slammed your head into a pillar.

264
00:13:05,200 --> 00:13:06,519
and were unconscious for two weeks.

265
00:13:07,080 --> 00:13:08,399
After that,

266
00:13:08,399 --> 00:13:11,159
you never mentioned Prince Chen again.

267
00:13:11,399 --> 00:13:13,559
(What a pair of star-crossed lovers.)

268
00:13:14,320 --> 00:13:17,080
(But none of this is in
the original Lu Yunluo's memories.)

269
00:13:17,799 --> 00:13:20,279
(Could it be traumatic amnesia?)

270
00:13:21,799 --> 00:13:23,960
At least you made it through.

271
00:13:24,360 --> 00:13:25,759
I'm so happy for you.

272
00:13:25,879 --> 00:13:26,840
There you go again,

273
00:13:27,159 --> 00:13:28,279
calling yourself a servant.

274
00:13:29,159 --> 00:13:32,720
You never used to open up to me
like this.

275
00:13:34,639 --> 00:13:35,759
(Without you,)

276
00:13:36,679 --> 00:13:38,799
(I'd have hanged myself at
the scene of that fire long ago.)

277
00:13:40,720 --> 00:13:41,519
Something's off.

278
00:13:42,759 --> 00:13:44,440
Something's definitely off.

279
00:13:44,720 --> 00:13:45,919
What's wrong, my lady?

280
00:13:47,039 --> 00:13:48,200
My lady, your period's here.

281
00:13:48,200 --> 00:13:49,720
Good thing I kept track.

282
00:13:54,480 --> 00:13:55,159
(Oh, no.)

283
00:13:55,159 --> 00:13:56,200
(I forgot the paper.)

284
00:14:03,440 --> 00:14:04,559
(Escape the palace now.)

285
00:14:04,840 --> 00:14:06,159
(Go to Xiqing.)

286
00:14:31,771 --> 00:14:35,801
♪By red walls and a dry well,
my crown gathers dust and frost♪

287
00:14:36,191 --> 00:14:40,411
♪With a hoe and a patch of wasteland,
I sow the moonlight♪

288
00:14:40,451 --> 00:14:44,631
♪Who says the Cold Palace
holds nothing but tears?♪

289
00:14:44,691 --> 00:14:48,881
♪I choose to fill it with fragrant wine♪

290
00:14:49,221 --> 00:14:53,281
♪Cool dew, starry nights,
wheat sprouts in my hands♪

291
00:14:53,351 --> 00:14:57,531
♪I shape fields, not painted brows,
and fill them with hope♪

292
00:14:57,971 --> 00:15:01,341
♪Gold and silver bloom from the soil♪

293
00:15:01,811 --> 00:15:06,491
♪I smile as the world storms on♪

294
00:15:08,151 --> 00:15:10,301
♪No finery to rival spring♪

295
00:15:10,481 --> 00:15:14,781
♪All I wish for are waves of green♪

296
00:15:17,191 --> 00:15:18,941
♪Where is beauty found?♪

297
00:15:19,121 --> 00:15:23,551
♪Just lift your eyes and see♪

298
00:15:24,111 --> 00:15:25,681
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

299
00:15:25,701 --> 00:15:28,171
♪Growing life's simple joys♪

300
00:15:28,241 --> 00:15:30,321
♪Bins full of grain, jars full of wine♪

301
00:15:30,481 --> 00:15:32,251
♪Better than dancing in silks♪

302
00:15:32,861 --> 00:15:34,131
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

303
00:15:34,361 --> 00:15:36,761
♪My heart longs for the world beyond♪

304
00:15:37,001 --> 00:15:39,301
♪Tending a courtyard full of life♪

305
00:15:39,581 --> 00:15:43,901
♪Come, share a cup with me♪
